category":"mentioned","context":false,"ordinal":1,"name":"Riviera"},{"section":11,"original_section":"1.10","place_id":"real-new-england","quote":"[…] out, I cast around for some place in the New England countryside or sleepy small town (elms, white church) where I […]","pages":[29],"terms":["New England"],"category":"mentioned","context":false,"ordinal":2,"name":"New England"},{"section":11,"original_section":"1.10","place_id":"Roches Roses","quote":"[…] of her shorts--that last mad immortal day behind the \\"Roches Roses.\\" […]","pages":[33],"terms":["Roches Roses"],"category":"mentioned","context":false,"ordinal":4,"name":"Roches Roses"},{"section":12,"original_section":"1.11","place_id":"paris","quote":"[…] boy in one of Monsieur Humbert Humbert''s classes in Paris called the poet-poet. […]","pages":[36,37],"terms":["Paris"],"category":"mentioned","context":false,"reference_id":"12:core:paris"},{"section":12,"original_section":"1.11","place_id":"florida","quote":"[…] side of which, counter to the unfinished outline of Florida and the Gulf, there was a mimeographed list of names […]","pages":[44],"terms":["Florida"],"category":"mentioned","context":false,"reference_id":"12:core:florida"},{"section":12,"original_section":"1.11","place_id":"new-york","quote":"[…] found to be thirteen years and nine months in New York and Chicago. […]","pages":[36],"terms":["New York"],"category":"mentioned","context":false,"reference_id":"12:core:new-york"},{"section":12,"original_section":"1.11","place_id":"new-hampshire","quote":"[…] May 30 is a Fast Day by Proclamation in New Hampshire but not in the Carolinas. […]","pages":[33],"terms":["New Hampshire"],"category":"mentioned","context":false,"reference_id":"12:core:new-hampshire"},{"section":12,"original_section":"1.11","place_id":"chicago","quote":"[…] thirteen years and nine months in New York and Chicago. […]","pages":[36],"terms":["Chicago"],"category":"mentioned","context":false,"reference_id":"12:core:chicago"},{"section":12,"original_section":"1.11","place_id":"france","quote":"[…] in my life--not even when fondling my child-love in France--never- Night. […]","pages":[37],"terms":["France"],"category":"mentioned","context":false,"reference_id":"12:core:france"},{"section":12,"original_section":"1.11","place_id":"regional-ramsdale","quote":"[…] A few days before that I moved into the Haze house, and the little diary which I now propose to reel off (much […] apple-green light behind the house. Strolled out. She wore a plaid shirt, blue jeans and sneakers. […]","pages":[34],"terms":["Haze house"],"category":"action","context":true,"rationale":"Le entrate del diario narrano incontri e conversazioni nella casa e nel giardino Haze.","region_index":0},{"section":12,"original_section":"1.11","place_id":"regional-riviera","quote":"[…] she smelt almost exactly like the other one, the Riviera one, but more intensely so, with rougher overtones--a torrid odor […]","pages":[35],"terms":["Riviera"],"category":"mentioned","context":false,"ordinal":1,"name":"Riviera"},{"section":12,"original_section":"1.11","place_id":"real-new-england","quote":"[…] coltish subteens, excruciatingly desirable from head to foot (all New England for a lady-writer''s pen!), from the black read-made bow and […]","pages":[41,42],"terms":["New England"],"category":"mentioned","context":false,"ordinal":2,"name":"New England"},{"section":12,"original_section":"1.11","place_id":"regional-pisky","quote":"[…] was better adjusted in her new school than in Pisky (Pisky was the Haze home town in the Middle West. […]","pages":[39],"terms":["Pisky"],"category":"mentioned","context":false,"ordinal":7,"name":"Pisky"},{"section":12,"original_section":"1.11","place_id":"Carolinas","quote":"[…] by Proclamation in New Hampshire but not in the Carolinas. […]","pages":[33],"terms":["Carolinas"],"category":"mentioned","context":false,"ordinal":5,"name":"Carolinas"},{"section":12,"original_section":"1.11","place_id":"Petersburg","quote":"[…