e:philadelphia"},{"section":67,"original_section":"2.33","place_id":"switzerland","quote":"[…] rather repulsive wine dealer, a relative of mine in Switzerland. […]","pages":[266],"terms":["Switzerland"],"category":"mentioned","context":false,"reference_id":"67:core:switzerland"},{"section":67,"original_section":"2.33","place_id":"regional-ramsdale","quote":"Ramsdale revisited. I approached it from the side of the lake. […]","pages":[262],"terms":["Ramsdale"],"category":"action","context":false,"rationale":"Visita al cimitero e alla vecchia casa, incontri e colloqui nel ritorno effettivo a Ramsdale.","region_index":0},{"section":67,"original_section":"2.33","place_id":"regional-parkington","quote":"[…] at his ancestral home, Grimm Road, not far from Parkington. […]","pages":[266],"terms":["Parkington"],"category":"mentioned","context":false,"ordinal":4,"name":"Parkington"},{"section":67,"original_section":"2.33","place_id":"regional-beardsley","quote":"[…] Had I not lived at one time at Beardsley? […]","pages":[265],"terms":["Beardsley"],"category":"mentioned","context":false,"ordinal":5,"name":"Beardsley"},{"section":67,"original_section":"2.33","place_id":"Northwest","quote":"[…] young mining engineer with a hush-hush job in the Northwest. […]","pages":[264],"terms":["Northwest"],"category":"mentioned","context":false,"ordinal":1,"name":"Northwest"},{"section":67,"original_section":"2.33","place_id":"Europe","quote":"[…] with the same dim, impossible garnet-red light that in Europe years ago went with low haunts, but here meant a […]","pages":[264],"terms":["Europe"],"category":"mentioned","context":false,"ordinal":6,"name":"Europe"},{"section":67,"original_section":"2.33","place_id":"Korea","quote":"[…] The poor boy has just been killed in Korea.\\" […]","pages":[264],"terms":["Korea"],"category":"mentioned","context":false,"ordinal":8,"name":"Korea"},{"section":68,"original_section":"2.34","place_id":"regional-parkington","quote":"A gas station attendant in Parkington explained to me very clearly how to get to Grimm Road. […]","pages":[267],"terms":["Parkington"],"category":"action","context":false,"rationale":"Richiesta d’indicazioni e telefonata al distributore di Parkington.","region_index":4},{"section":69,"original_section":"2.35","place_id":"england","quote":"[…] a word comfortable, so, since I intend retiring to England or Florence forever, I suggest you move in. […]","pages":[274],"terms":["England"],"category":"mentioned","context":false,"reference_id":"69:core:england"},{"section":69,"original_section":"2.35","place_id":"florence","quote":"[…] comfortable, so, since I intend retiring to England or Florence forever, I suggest you move in. […]","pages":[274],"terms":["Florence"],"category":"mentioned","context":false,"reference_id":"69:core:florence"},{"section":69,"original_section":"2.35","place_id":"philadelphia","quote":"[…] Phil calls Philadelphia. […]","pages":[270],"terms":["Philadelphia"],"category":"mentioned","context":false,"reference_id":"69:core:philadelphia"},{"section":69,"original_section":"2.35","place_id":"patagonia","quote":"[…] Pat calls Patagonia. […]","pages":[270],"terms":["Patagonia"],"category":"mentioned","context":false,"reference_id":"69:core:patagonia"},{"section":69,"original_section":"2.35","place_id":"regional-parkington","quote":"[…] next morning around eight and spent some time in Parkington. […] of the way back to Grimm Road, but when I reached Pavor Manor, the sun was visible again, burning […]","pages":[268],"terms":["Parkington"],"category":"action","context":false,"rationale":"Esplorazione della casa e omicidio lungo Grimm Road a nord di Parkington; la collocazione resta regionale, non un indirizzo urbano.","region_index":4},{"section":69,"original_section":"2.35","place_id":"Dolores, Colo","quote":"[…] Dolly called Dolores, Colo.?\\" […]","pages":[270],"terms":["Dolores, Colo"],"category":"mentioned","context":false,"ordinal":1,"name":"Dolores, Colo"},{"section":69,"original_section":"2.35","place_id":"Hell Canyon","quote":"[…] Paradise, Wash., Hell Canyon. […]","pages":[270],"terms":["Hell Canyon"],"category":"mentioned","context":false,"ordinal":6,"name":"Hell Canyon"},{"section":69,"original_section":"2.35","place_id":"Rio","quote":"[…] rencontre, sword or pistol, in Rio or elsewhere--is not excluded. […]","pages":[274],"terms":["Rio"],"category":"mentioned","context":false,"ordinal":7,"name":"Rio"},{"section":69,"original_section":"2.35","place_id":"Old Faithful","quote":"[…] higher and higher, like old, gray, mad Nijinski, like Old faithful, like some old nightmare of mine, to a phenomenal altitude, […]","pages":[276],"terms":["Old faithful"],"category":"mentioned","context":false,"ordinal":10,"name":"Old Faithful"},{"section":70,"original_section":"2.36","place_id":"alaska","quote":"[…] I can still talk to you from here to Alaska. […]","pages":[282],"terms":["Alaska"],"category":"mentioned","context":false,"reference_id":"70:core:alaska"},{"section":70,"original_section":"2.36","place_id":"regional-parkington","quote":"[…] the same lazy pace in a direction opposite to Parkington. […]","pages":[278],"terms":["Parkington"],"category":"mentioned","context":false,"ordinal":0,"name":"Parkington"},{"section":70,"original_section":"2.36","place_id":"Strada montana e parapetto anonimi","quote":"[…] to the lip of granite where I stood wiping my foul mouth. […]","pages":[280],"terms":["lip of granite"],"category":"action","context":true,"rationale":"A narrated event takes place in this setting; the chapter context establishes its identity.","ordinal":1,"name":"Strada montana e parapetto anonimi"},{"section":70,"original_section":"2.36","place_id":"Cittadina mineraria anonima nella valle","quote":"[…] vapor from a small mining town that lay at my feet, in a […]","pages":[280],"terms":["mining town"],"category":"mentioned","context":true,"ordinal":2,"name":"Cittadina mineraria anonima nella valle"}]'::jsonb) as x(section integer,original_section text,place_id text,quote text,pages jsonb,terms jsonb,category text,context boolean,rationale text,reference_id text,region_index integer,ordinal integer,name text);
